hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"936","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke wo haiz se thi, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke zamane mein. Phir Umar bin al-Khattab ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se is ke bare mein poochha. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use hukm do ke wo us se ruju kare, phir use roke yahan tak ke wo paak ho, phir haiz se ho, phir paak ho. Phir agar chahe is ke baad roke, agar chahe chhue se pehle talaq de. Phir ye wo iddat hai jis ka Allah ne hukm diya hai ke aurton ko us ke liye talaq di jaye."
"937","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar se Yunus bin Jubair ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar se poochha. To unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umar ne apni biwi ko talaq di jabke wo haiz se thi. Phir Umar ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se poochha. To Aap ne unhe hukm diya ke wo us se ruju kare, phir us ki iddat se pehle talaq de. Main ne kaha: Phir wo us talaq se iddat guzare? Unhon ne kaha: Batayo, agar wo aajiz ho aur bewaqoof bane?"
"938","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Haram mein kaffara hai. Aur farmaya: [Beshak tumhare liye Rasulullah mein umda namuna hai]."
"939","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Zainab bint Jahsh ke paas theharte aur un ke paas shehed peete. Phir main ne aur Hafsa ne baham mashwara kiya ke hum mein se jis ke paas Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dakhil hon wo kahe: Beshak main tum se maghafeer ki boo pati hun. Tum ne maghafeer khaye hain? Phir Aap un mein se ek ke paas dakhil hue to us ne Aap se ye kaha. To Aap ne farmaya: Nahi, balke main ne Zainab bint Jahsh ke paas shehed piya hai, aur main us ki taraf kabhi nahi lautunga. Phir ye nazil hui [ae Nabi! Tum kyun haram karte ho jo Allah ne tumhare liye halal kiya] se [agar tum dono Allah ki taraf tauba karo] tak, Aisha aur Hafsa ke liye. Aur jab Nabi ne apni kuchh biwiyon se poshida baat kahi, Aap ke qaul ke liye: Balke main ne shehed piya hai."
"940","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) shehed aur mithas pasand farmate. Aur jab Aap Asr se phirte to apni biwiyon ke paas dakhil hote aur un mein se ek se qareeb hote. Phir Aap Hafsa bint Umar ke paas dakhil hue to jitna Aap theharte they us se zyada thehre. Phir mujhe ghairat aayi. Phir main ne is ke bare mein poochha. To mujh se kaha gaya: Un ki qaum ki ek aurat ne unhe shehed ka bartan hadiya kiya hai. Phir unhon ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko us mein se sharbat pilaya. Phir main ne kaha: Suno! Allah ki qasam! Hum Aap ke liye zaroor chaal chalenge. Phir main ne Sauda bint Zam'a se kaha: Wo anqareeb tum se qareeb honge. Phir jab wo tum se qareeb hon to kaho: Tum ne maghafeer khaye hain? Kyunke Wo tum se farmayenge: Nahi. Phir un se kaho: Ye kaisi boo hai jo main tum se pati hun? Kyunke Wo tum se farmayenge: Mujhe Hafsa ne shehed ka sharbat pilaya hai. Phir un se kaho: Us ki makhhi ne urfut choosa hai. Aur main ye kahungi. Aur tum ae Safiyya! Ye kaho. Unhon ne kaha: Sauda kehti hain: Allah ki qasam! Wo sirf ye tha ke Wo darwaze par khade hue to main ne Aap ko wo batane mein jaldi karna chaha jo tum ne mujhe hukm farmaya tha, tum se darte hue. Phir jab Wo un se qareeb hue to Sauda ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Tum ne maghafeer khaye hain? Aap ne farmaya: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ye kaisi boo hai jo main tum se pati hun? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe Hafsa ne shehed ka sharbat pilaya hai. To unhon ne kaha: Us ki makhhi ne urfut choosa hai. Phir jab Aap meri taraf ghoome to main ne Aap se is jaisa kaha. Phir jab Aap Safiyya ki taraf ghoome to unhon ne Aap se is jaisa kaha. Phir jab Aap Hafsa ki taraf ghoome to unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)! Kya main tumhe us mein se na pilaun? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe is ki hajat nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Sauda kehti hain: Allah ki qasam! Beshak hum ne Aap ko mehroom kar diya. Main ne un se kaha: Khamosh raho."
"941","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko apni biwiyon ko ikhtiyar dene ka hukm diya gaya to Aap ne mujh se ibtida farmayi. To Aap ne farmaya: Beshak main tumhe ek mamla batane wala hun. Phir tum par koi harj nahi ke tum jaldi na karo yahan tak ke apne walidain se mashwara lo. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap jante they ke mere walidain mujhe Aap se juda hone ka hukm na denge. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne farmaya: Beshak Allah Jalla Sana'uhu ne farmaya [ae Nabi! Apni biwiyon se kaho agar tum duniya ki zindagi aur us ki zeenat chahti ho] se [bada ajr] tak. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne kaha: Phir is mein main apne walidain se mashwara kyun lun? Beshak main Allah, Us ke Rasool aur Aakhirat ke ghar ko chahti hun. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon ne waisa hi kiya jaisa main ne kiya."
"942","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se Muadha ke hawale se, Aisha se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) hum mein se aurat ke din mein ijazat mangte, is ayat ke nazil hone ke baad [tum un mein se jise chaho muakkhar karo, jise chaho apne paas rakho, jise tum ne alag kiya us mein se jise chaho, tum par koi gunah nahi]. Phir main ne un se kaha: Tum kya kehti thein? Unhon ne kaha: Main Aap se kehti thi: Agar ye mere paas ho to beshak main nahi chahti, Ya Rasulullah! Ke main tum par kisi ko tarjeeh dun."
"943","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein ikhtiyar diya. Phir hum ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ko ikhtiyar kiya. Phir Aap ne isے hum par kuchh na gina."
"944","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab se Ibn Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ek saal thehra ke Umar bin al-Khattab se ek ayat ke bare mein poochhun. Phir main Aap se Aap ki haibat se poochh na saka. Yahan tak ke Wo hajj ke liye nikle to main un ke sath nikla. Phir jab main lauta, jab hum raste mein they, Wo apni hajat ke liye arak ki taraf hate. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main Aap ke liye khada raha yahan tak ke Wo farigh hue. Phir main Aap ke sath chala. Phir main ne arz kiya: Amir al-Muminin! Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon mein se wo kaun do hain jinhon ne Aap par zahir ki? To unhon ne farmaya: Wo Hafsa aur Aisha hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne arz kiya: Allah ki qasam! Beshak main ek saal se tum se is ke bare mein poochhna chahta tha, phir tumhari haibat se taqat na rakhta tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir aisa na karo. Jo tum gumaan karo ke mere paas ilm mein se hai to mujh se poochho. Phir agar mere paas ilm hua to tumhe khabar dunga. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Umar ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak hum jahiliyat mein aurton ke liye koi mamla na mante they, yahan tak ke Allah ne un mein jo nazil farmaya nazil farmaya, aur un ke liye jo taqseem farmaya taqseem farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab main ek mamle mein tha jis ka main irada karta tha to meri biwi ne kaha: Kash tum aisa aur aisa karo. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne us se kaha: Tumhe aur yahan kya hai? Tum takalluf mein kyun ho us mamle mein jis ka main irada karta hun? Phir us ne mujh se kaha: Ibn al-Khattab! Tum par ta'ajjub hai. Tum nahi chahte ke tum se jawab diya jaye, jabke tumhari beti Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jawab deti hai yahan tak ke Wo apna din ghazab-naak guzarte hain. Phir Umar khade hue aur apni chadar wahin li yahan tak ke Hafsa ke paas dakhil hue. Phir un se kaha: Ae beti! Beshak tum Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko jawab deti ho yahan tak ke Wo apna din ghazab-naak guzarte hain? To Hafsa ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Beshak hum Aap ko jawab dete hain. Phir main ne kaha: Tum janti ho ke main tumhe Allah ki saza aur Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghazab se darata hun. Ae beti! Tumhe wo dhoka na de jisے us ke husn ne dhoka diya, Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki us se mohabbat ne [Aisha ka irada hai]. Unhon ne kaha: Phir main nikla yahan tak ke Umm Salama ke paas dakhil hua, meri un se rishtedari ki wajah se. Phir main ne un se baat ki. To Umm Salama ne kaha: Ibn al-Khattab! Tum par ta'ajjub hai. Tum har cheez mein dakhil ho gaye yahan tak ke tum chahte ho ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aur Aap ki biwiyon ke darmiyan dakhil ho? Phir unhon ne mujhe pakda, Allah ki qasam! Aise pakda jis ne mujhe us se tod diya jo main pata tha. Phir main un ke paas se nikla. Aur mera Ansar mein se ek sathi tha. Jab main ghayab hota wo mere paas khabar lata, aur jab wo ghayab hota main us ke paas khabar lata. Aur hum Ghassan ke badshahon mein se ek badshah se darte they, hamare liye zikr kiya gaya ke wo hamari taraf chalna chahta hai. Phir hamare seene us se bhar gaye they. Phir mera Ansari sathi darwaza khatkhataya. Phir us ne kaha: Kholo, kholo. Phir main ne kaha: Ghassani aaya? Us ne kaha: Balke is se sakht. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni biwiyon se alag thalag ikhtiyar kiya hai. Phir main ne kaha: Hafsa aur Aisha ki naak khaak-aalood ho. Phir main ne apna kapda liya aur nikla yahan tak ke aaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne ek kamre mein they jis par Aap seedhi se chadhte they. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka ek siyah ghulam seedhi ke sar par tha. Phir main ne us se kaha: Kaho ye Umar bin al-Khattab hai. Phir us ne mujhe ijazat di. Umar ne kaha: Phir main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko ye hadith bayan ki. Phir jab main Umm Salama ki hadith pahuncha to Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuraye, jabke Wo chatai par they, Aap ke aur us ke darmiyan kuchh na tha. Aur Aap ke sar ke neeche chamde ka takiya tha jis ka bharav chhaal thi. Aur Aap ke paon ke paas qarz jama tha, Aap ke sar ke paas latki hui mashkein thein. Phir main ne Aap ke pehlu mein chatai ka nishan dekha. Phir main roya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tumhe kya rulata hai? Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Kisra aur Qaisar jis mein hain us mein hain, jabke tum Rasulullah ho. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum raazi nahi ke un ke liye duniya ho aur hamare liye Aakhirat?"
"945","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar se Abdullah bin Abbas ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main hamesha Umar bin al-Khattab se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon mein se un do aurton ke bare mein poochhne ka harees raha jin ke bare mein Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya [agar tum dono Allah ki taraf tauba karo to beshak tumhare dil jhuk gaye hain]. Yahan tak ke unhon ne hajj kiya aur main ne un ke sath hajj kiya. Aur Wo hate aur main un ke sath bartan se hata. Phir Wo farigh hue, phir aaye. Phir main ne un ke hathon par us mein se undela aur unhon ne wuzu farmaya. Phir main ne un se arz kiya: Amir al-Muminin! Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyon mein se wo kaun do aurtein hain jin ke bare mein Allah Ta'ala ne farmaya [agar tum dono Allah ki taraf tauba karo to beshak tumhare dil jhuk gaye hain]? Unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abbas! Tum par ta'ajjub hai. Wo Aisha aur Hafsa hain. Phir Umar ne hadith ka istiqbal kiya use chalate hue. Unhon ne kaha: Main aur Ansar mein se mera ek padosi Bani Umayya bin Zaid mein they, jo Madina ke unche hisse mein se hain. Aur hum Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par utarne mein bari-bari karte. Phir wo ek din utarta aur main ek din utarta. Phir jab main utarta to us din ki khabar mein se jo hua usے lekar aata, wahi se ya us ke siwa se. Aur jab wo utarta to is jaisa karta. Aur hum, Quraish ki jamaat, aurton par ghalib they. Phir jab hum Ansar ke paas aaye to ek qaum jin par un ki aurtein ghalib thin. Phir hamari aurtein Ansar ke adab mein se lene lagein. Phir main apni biwi par chillaya to us ne mujhe jawab diya. Phir main ne inkar kiya ke wo mujhe jawab de. Us ne kaha: Tum kyun inkar karte ho ke main tumhe jawab dun? Allah ki qasam! Beshak Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki biwiyan Aap ko jawab deti hain. Aur beshak un mein se ek Aap se din bhar raat tak alag rehti hai. Phir mujhe is ne daraya. Aur main ne us se kaha: Un mein se jo aisa kare wo nakam hua. Phir main ne apne kapde jama kiye aur utra aur Hafsa ke paas dakhil hua. Phir main ne un se kaha: Ae Hafsa! Kya tum mein se ek Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se din bhar raat tak naraaz rehti hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Phir main ne kaha: Tum nakam aur khasare mein rahin. Kya tum aman patin ke Allah tum par Us ke Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghazab se ghazab farmaye aur tum halak ho jao? Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se zyada na mango, Aap ko kisi cheez mein jawab na do, Aap se alag na raho, aur mujh se mango jo tumhe zahir ho. Aur tumhe dhoka na de ke tumhari padosan tum se zyada ujli aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko tum se zyada mehboob hai [Aisha ka irada hai]. Umar ne kaha: Aur hum ne guftagu ki thi ke Ghassan hamse ladne ke liye ghodon ko naal bandh rahe hain. Phir mera Ansari sathi apni bari ke din utra. Phir hamari taraf shaam ko lauta aur mera darwaza zor se khatkhataya. Aur kaha: Kya wo hai? Phir main dara aur us ke paas nikla. To us ne kaha: Aaj bada mamla hua hai. Main ne kaha: Wo kya hai? Kya Ghassan aaya? Us ne kaha: Nahi, balke is se bada aur haul-naak. Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni biwiyon ko talaq di. Phir main ne kaha: Hafsa nakam aur khasare mein rahi. Beshak main gumaan karta tha ke ye anqareeb hone wala hai. Phir main ne apne kapde jama kiye aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sath Fajr ki namaz parhi. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apne kamre mein dakhil hue aur us mein alag thalag rahe. Aur main Hafsa ke paas dakhil hua to wo ro rahi thin. Phir main ne kaha: Tumhe kya rulata hai? Kya main ne tumhe is se na daraya tha? Kya Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhe talaq di? Unhon ne kaha: Main nahi janti. Wo hain alag thalag kamre mein. Phir main nikla aur mimbar ke paas aaya. Phir us ke ird-gird giroh tha, un mein se kuchh ro rahe they. Phir main un ke sath thodi der baitha. Phir mujh par jo pata tha ghalib aa gaya. Phir main us kamre ke paas aaya jismein Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) they. Phir main ne Aap ke siyah ghulam se kaha: Umar ke liye ijazat mango. Phir ghulam dakhil hua aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se baat ki. Phir lauta aur kaha: Main ne Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se baat ki aur tumhara zikr kiya to Wo khamosh rahe. Phir main phira yahan tak ke un giroh ke sath baitha jo mimbar ke paas they. Phir mujh par jo pata tha ghalib aa gaya. Phir main aaya aur ghulam se kaha: Umar ke liye ijazat mango. Phir wo dakhil hua phir lauta. Phir us ne kaha: Main ne Aap se tumhara zikr kiya to Wo khamosh rahe. Phir main lauta aur un giroh ke sath baitha jo mimbar ke paas they. Phir mujh par jo pata tha ghalib aa gaya. Phir main ghulam ke paas aaya aur kaha: Umar ke liye ijazat mango. Phir wo dakhil hua phir mere paas lauta aur kaha: Main ne Aap se tumhara zikr kiya to Wo khamosh rahe. Phir jab main peeth pher kar phira [unhon ne kaha] to ghulam mujhe bula raha tha. Phir us ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tumhe ijazat di hai. Phir main Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hua. Phir Wo chatai ke reshوں par lete they, Aap ke aur us ke darmiyan bichhauna na tha. Reshon ne Aap ke pehlu mein nishan dal diya tha. Chamde ke takiye par tek lagaye jis ka bharav chhaal thi. Phir main ne Aap ko salam kiya. Phir main ne arz kiya, jabke main khada tha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya tum ne apni biwiyon ko talaq di? Phir Aap ne meri taraf apni nazar uthayi aur farmaya: Nahi. Phir main ne kaha: Allahu Akbar! Phir main ne arz kiya, jabke main khada tha: Unsiyat chahte hue. Ya Rasulullah! Kash tum mujhe dekhte. Aur hum, Quraish ki jamaat, aurton par ghalib they. Phir jab hum Madina aaye to ek qaum jin par un ki aurtein ghalib thin. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) muskuraye. Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kash tum mujhe dekhte. Aur main Hafsa ke paas dakhil hua. Phir main ne un se kaha: Tumhe dhoka na de ke tumhari padosan tum se zyada ujli aur Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko tum se zyada mehboob hai [Aisha ka irada hai]. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) doosri martaba muskuraye. Phir main baitha jab main ne Aap ko muskurate dekha. Phir main ne Aap ke ghar mein apni nazar uthayi. Allah ki qasam! Main ne Aap ke ghar mein nazar pherne wali cheez ke siwa teen khaalein nahi dekhein. Phir main ne arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua farmayiye ke Wo tumhari ummat par wus'at farmaye. Kyunke Faris aur Room par wus'at ki gayi hai aur unhe duniya di gayi hai jabke wo Allah ki ibadat nahi karte. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithe jabke Aap tek lagaye they. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum is mein ho ae Ibn al-Khattab? Beshak wo aisi qaum hain jin ki paak cheezein unhe duniya ki zindagi mein jaldi di gayein. Phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mere liye maghfirat mango. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us hadith ki wajah se apni biwiyon se alag thalag ikhtiyar kiya, jab Hafsa ne use Aisha ko faash kiya, untees raatein. Aur Aap ne kaha tha: Main un par mahina dakhil nahi hunga, un par apne sakht ghusse se, jab Allah ne Aap ko itab farmaya. Phir jab untees raatein guzar gayein to Aap Aisha ke paas dakhil hue aur un se ibtida farmayi. Phir Aisha ne Aap se kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak tum ne qasam khayi thi ke tum hum par mahina dakhil nahi hoge. Aur tum untees raaton mein se subah kar chuke ho jinhe main ginti hoon. To Aap ne farmaya: Mahina untees ka hai. Phir wo mahina untees raaton ka tha. Aisha ne kaha: Phir Allah Ta'ala ne ikhtiyar ki ayat nazil farmayi. Phir Aap ne mujh se ibtida farmayi, Aap ki biwiyon mein se pehli aurat. Phir main ne Aap ko ikhtiyar kiya. Phir Aap ne apni tamam biwiyon ko ikhtiyar diya. Phir unhon ne waisa hi kaha jaisa Aisha ne kaha."
"946","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha aur Fatima bint Qais se Aisha ke hawale se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Fatima ko kya hua ke wo Allah se nahi darti? Matlab us ke qaul mein ke rehne ki jagah aur kharcha nahi."
"947","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha aur Fatima bint Qais se riwayat hai, Urwa bin al-Zubair ne Aisha se kaha: Kya tum ne falan bint al-Hakam ko nahi dekha? Us ke shohar ne use mukammal talaq di aur wo nikli. To unhon ne kaha: Us ne bura kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne Fatima ke qaul mein nahi suna? Unhon ne kaha: Suno! Beshak us ke liye is hadith ke zikr mein koi bhalayi nahi."
"948","[AI-translation] Hazrat Subai'a bint al-Harith (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke wo Sa'd bin Khaula ke nikah mein thein, jo Bani Amir bin Luayy mein se they. Aur wo un mein se they jo Badr mein hazir hue. Phir Wo Hajjat al-Wada mein un se faut ho gaye jabke wo hamla se thein. Phir unhon ne der na ki ke unhon ne apne hamal ko un ki wafat ke baad jana. Phir jab wo nifas se paak huein to paigham dene walon ke liye tayyar huein. Phir un ke paas Abu al-Sanabil bin Ba'kak dakhil hue, jo Bani Abd al-Dar mein se ek mard they. Phir unhon ne un se kaha: Mujhe kya hai ke main tumhe paigham dene walon ke liye tayyar dekhta hun? Tum nikah ki ummeed rakhti ho? Phir beshak tum, Allah ki qasam! Nikah karne wali nahi ho yahan tak ke tum par chaar mahine dus din guzrein. Subai'a ne kaha: Phir jab unhon ne mujh se ye kaha to main ne shaam hote apne kapde jama kiye. Aur Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se is ke bare mein poochha. Phir Aap ne mujhe fatwa diya ke main halal ho gayi hun jab main ne apna hamal jana, aur mujhe nikah ka hukm diya agar mujhe zahir ho."
"949","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salama se Abu Salama ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Ibn Abbas ke paas aaya jabke Abu Hurairah un ke paas baithe they. Phir us ne kaha: Mujhe us aurat ke bare mein fatwa dijiye jo apne shohar ke baad chalees raaton mein jani. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Dono muddaton mein se aakhri. Main ne kaha [aur hamal waliyon ki muddat ye hai ke wo apna hamal janein]. Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Main apne bhatije ke sath hun [matlab Abu Salama]. Phir Ibn Abbas ne apne ghulam Kuraib ko Umm Salama ki taraf bheja taake un se poochhe. To unhon ne kaha: Subai'a al-Aslamiya ke shohar qatl hue jabke wo hamla se thein. Phir unhon ne un ki maut ke baad chalees raaton mein jana. Phir unhe paigham diya gaya. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un ka nikah farmaya, jabke Abu al-Sanabil un mein se they jinhon ne unhe paigham diya tha."
"950","[AI-translation] Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Hazrat Umm Habiba, Zainab bint Jahsh, Umm Salama aur Zainab bint Abi Salama se riwayat hai. Zainab ne kaha: Main Umm Habiba zauja Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas dakhil hui jab un ke walid Abu Sufyan bin Harb faut hue. Phir Umm Habiba ne khushboo mangwayi jis mein zardi thi, khalooq ya us ke siwa. Phir unhon ne us mein se londi ko lagaya. Phir apne dono rukhsaron ko chhua. Phir kaha: Allah ki qasam! Mujhe khushboo ki koi hajat nahi. Magar beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmate suna: Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman lane wali aurat ke liye halal nahi ke wo maiyat par teen raaton se zyada sog kare, magar shohar par chaar mahine dus din. Zainab ne kaha: Phir main Zainab bint Jahsh ke paas dakhil hui jab un ke bhai faut hue. Phir unhon ne khushboo mangwayi aur us mein se lagaya. Phir kaha: Suno! Allah ki qasam! Mujhe khushboo ki koi hajat nahi. Magar beshak main ne Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko mimbar par farmate suna: Allah aur Aakhirat ke din par iman lane wali aurat ke liye halal nahi ke wo maiyat par teen raaton se zyada sog kare, magar shohar par chaar mahine dus din. Zainab ne kaha: Aur main ne Umm Salama ko kehte suna: Ek aurat Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak meri beti se us ka shohar faut ho gaya hai. Aur us ki aankh mein dard hai. To kya main use surma lagaun? To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, do ya teen martaba. Har martaba farmate: Nahi. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo to chaar mahine dus din hai. Aur tum mein se ek jahiliyat mein saal ke sar par mengni phenkti thi. Humaid ne kaha [Zainab se rawi]: Phir main ne Zainab se kaha: Saal ke sar par mengni phenkna kya hai? To Zainab ne kaha: Aurat jab us se us ka shohar faut ho jata to chhote ghar mein dakhil hoti aur bure kapde pehenti. Aur khushboo na lagati yahan tak ke us par saal guzarta. Phir us ke paas janwar laya jata: Gadha, bakri ya parinda. Phir wo us se farigh hoti. Phir wo kisi cheez se farigh na hoti magar wo mar jata. Phir wo nikalti aur mengni di jati aur phenkti. Phir us ke baad jo chahe khushboo ya us ke siwa laut-ti. Malik se poochha gaya [sanad ke ek rawi]: Wo us se kya farigh hoti? Unhon ne kaha: Wo us se apni khaal ponchhti."
"951","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Atiyya (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hamein mana kiya jata tha ke hum maiyat par teen se zyada sog karein, magar shohar par chaar mahine dus din. Aur hum surma na lagayein, khushboo na lagayein, range hue kapde na pehnein magar asb ka kapda. Aur hamein taharat ke waqt ijazat di gayi thi jab hum mein se ek haiz se ghusl kare toqust azfar ki thodi mein."
